  "published": "2026-08-19T01:43:16.287Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2026.1.0\n\n      - BREAKING: dropped net48 and netstandard2.0; now targets netstandard2.1 and net10.0\n      - BREAKING: removed the bundled Common.Logging shim; logging is Microsoft.Extensions.Logging only\n      - BREAKING: removed the APM BeginSendPdu/EndSendPdu and BeginSendMessage/EndSendMessage pairs\n      - changed: the library depends on Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions only\n      - fix: ResponseHandlerV2 delivered a response without removing it, so the response\n        queue grew for the whole life of a session; delivery is now once-only and\n        responses nobody claims expire instead of accumulating\n      - fix: a response arriving between a waiter's check and its wait could be missed,\n        leaving the caller blocked until its timeout\n      - fix: TcpIpSession send/receive now honour the CancellationToken they accept\n      - improve: package versions managed centrally; SourceLink now comes from the SDK",
